Lighter graphics defaults on Android (warecomp).

The PC defaults (Auto resolution, the screen's refresh rate, MSAA 2x) ran slowly on phones:
the full native resolution, every frame of a 90 or 120 Hz screen interpolated. On Android a new
install starts at Original 2x (480p), the game's own framerate and no MSAA. Saved settings
are kept.

